SUMMARY:Bible Study (Guild Room)
DESCRIPTION:The Tuesday Daytime Bible Study Group meets weekly in the Guild Room\, offering opportunities to explore faith\, the Bible\, Christian history\, Union Church\, and societal concerns. Beginning September 15\, the group will read and discuss The False White Gospel: Rejecting Christian Nationalism by Rev. Jim Wallis. Later in the year\, the group will also explore non-canonical biblical texts with Rev. Katrina. Newcomers are welcome – come join the conversation!
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/bible-study-guild-room/2026-11-17/
LOCATION:Guild Room
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Christian Education,Featured Events,Small Groups
ORGANIZER;CN="Union Congregational Event":MAILTO:contact@unioncong.org
END:VEVENT
