SUMMARY:Baking with Grandmas Around the World (Guild Room and Kitchen)
DESCRIPTION:Each week\, children bake cookies from a different country and culture. Along the way they learn about the country the recipe comes from\, its traditions\, and the word for “grandmother” in that language. They work in small groups at five baking stations\, measuring\, mixing\, following recipes\, collaborating\, and building real baking skills. Every child takes home a book of the recipes they made at the end of the 8-week class.
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/baking-with-grandmas-around-the-world-guild-room-and-kitchen/2026-11-17/
LOCATION:Guild Room and Kitchen\, 176 Cooper Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Events
ORGANIZER;CN="Dumpling Diplomacy":MAILTO:nancy.loo@dumplingdiplomacy.com
END:VEVENT
